# Executive Director (JF) > 5. Institutional relationships and development
JF leads OCE’s strategic external relationships, including:
major foundations, funders and institutional donors;

# Executive Director (JF) > 5. Institutional relationships and development
JF leads OCE’s strategic external relationships, including:
strategic partners and prospective partners;

# Executive Director (JF) > 5. Institutional relationships and development
JF leads OCE’s strategic external relationships, including:
high-value or organization-shaping projects;

# Executive Director (JF) > 5. Institutional relationships and development
JF leads OCE’s strategic external relationships, including:
Open Finance Consortium at the institutional and strategic level;

# Executive Director (JF) > 5. Institutional relationships and development
JF leads OCE’s strategic external relationships, including:
advisers, legal counsel and other senior external stakeholders;

# Executive Director (JF) > 5. Institutional relationships and development
For example:
Laura manages the operational relationship with Myriad USA, while JF remains involved in supervision and major strategic, contractual or risk matters;

# Executive Director (JF) > 5. Institutional relationships and development
For example:
Laura leads the operational implementation of Ma Earth, while JF retains the strategic relationship and major negotiations;

