JF’s work is assessed through:
progress against OCE’s strategic priorities;

# Executive Director (JF) > 12. Success measures
JF’s work is assessed through:
financial sustainability and visibility;

# Executive Director (JF) > 12. Success measures
JF’s work is assessed through:
